Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 03:56:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix: bound runner websocket silence and clarify transport
 status

Expire native WebSocket sessions after 90 seconds without valid inbound
activity and bound sends to 30 seconds, using the existing reconnect and
JobManager continuation path. Distinguish stale heartbeat without recorded
close from observed transport disconnect; keep the 60-second readiness gate.

Validated the exact five-file candidate with fmt, Runner/Server check,
7 liveness tests, 103 transport tests, 4 diagnostic tests, 19 reconnect tests
and 1 stale-metadata test. Original upstream baseline is
37098d4624f0000bfab54ad102ecb0df619d7dc6; this origin record applies to this
candidate commit and does not infer provenance for historical commits.

Origin: ai-assisted:gpt-6.1-sol-codex
